[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 964.23, "timestamp": "00:16:04", "text": "我看到了戰鬥燈光。好的，我看到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 969.189, "timestamp": "00:16:09", "text": "戰鬥燈。好的。 M：是的。一秒鐘。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 979.226, "timestamp": "00:16:19", "text": "好的。背景中是馬拉鬆比賽的畫面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 980.389, "timestamp": "00:16:20", "text": "[笑聲]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 984.87, "timestamp": "00:16:24", "text": "為什麼？過來。你必須振作起來。快點。去做。要嘛"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 989.67, "timestamp": "00:16:29", "text": "親自來，要嘛"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 991.35, "timestamp": "00:16:31", "text": "親自展示。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 994.946, "timestamp": "00:16:34", "text": "哦，結束了。好的。好的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 995.189, "timestamp": "00:16:35", "text": "[嘆氣]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 997.829, "timestamp": "00:16:37", "text": "所以，呃，培根是這"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 999.749, "timestamp": "00:16:39", "text": "行的老手，而我是個新手。  我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1001.43, "timestamp": "00:16:41", "text": "不是退伍軍人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1002.71, "timestamp": "00:16:42", "text": "你玩這個遊戲玩了很久。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1005.509, "timestamp": "00:16:45", "text": "哦，你可以這麼說。我猜"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1008.23, "timestamp": "00:16:48", "text": "你玩"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1017.269, "timestamp": "00:16:57", "text": "這個遊戲玩得太多了，都忘了自己玩這個遊戲有多頻繁了。  你在這方面很專業。  勉強進入遊戲，例如進入最終boss戰之類的。這需要付出很多努力。玩這場比賽，你必須"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1019.35, "timestamp": "00:16:59", "text": "要有團隊，老兄。"}]